  "description": "Automatic HTTP traffic collection middleware for Azure App Services. Zero code changes required. Uses ASP.NET Core IHostingStartup to inject middleware for comprehensive API security monitoring. Supports .NET 6.0, 8.0, and 9.0. Captures complete request/response data including headers, bodies, and timing information. Sends data in real-time to Salt Security API for advanced threat detection and security analysis.",
